## 🚀 How to Run & Verify Locally

### Step 1: Deploy Supabase Migrations
Apply the monetization migration onto your local or staging Supabase instance:
```bash
npx supabase migration up
```

### Step 2: Run Development Server
Start the frontend and backend local environment:
```bash
npm run dev
```

### Step 3: Test API Endpoints
You can simulate Stripe webhooks locally using the Stripe CLI:
```bash
stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/payments/webhook
```
